<title>FINLAND: Cultor 4-mth sales by division.</title>
<headline>Cultor 4-mth sales by division.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish food stuffs, feeds and bakery group Cultor Oy on Wednesday gave the following breakdown of net sales and operating profit by division for January-April (million markka):</p>
<p> NET SALES	    Jan-April '97   Jan-April '96</p>
<p> Food Science	    653		  593</p>
<p> Feed Ingredients	142		   97</p>
<p> Baking		    382		  304</p>
<p> Nutrition	     1,149		1,035</p>
<p> Others		    195		  483</p>
<p> TOTAL		   2,521		2,512</p>
<p> OPERATING PROFIT   Jan-April '97   Jan-April '96</p>
<p> Food Science	     50		  44</p>
<p> Feed Ingredients	  8		   8</p>
<p> Baking		     15		  18</p>
<p> Nutrition		  35		  46</p>
<p> Others		     -7		 -26</p>
<p> TOTAL		     101		  90</p>
<p>--Helsinki Newsroom +358-9-680 50 240, news@reuters.fi</p>
